GPU noslip solver for MuJoCo Warp (author: Keyshav Mor), needed by the dog tasks of the DeepMind Control Suite.
Adds mujoco_warp/_src/noslip.py (port of MuJoCo's mj_solNoSlip, pyramidal cones) and hooks it into the
constraint solver (solver.py), the Option fields (types.py) and the model checks (io.py).
Base: https://github.com/google-deepmind/mujoco_warp commit 2c09ab908e5cd50cdabd1194713ba58e601899ee.
Apply with scripts/setup_mujoco_warp.sh (or: git apply 0001-gpu-noslip-solver.patch). License: Apache 2.0, as MuJoCo Warp.

